<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu Denso up on earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu Denso up on earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Denso Ltd shares were higher in early Tuesday morning trade after the company on Monday revised upward its earnings for the year to March 31, 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0055 GMT, the shares were up 100 yen at 3,570 in a turnover of 88,000.</p>
<p>On Monday, the manufacturer of transmission, power source, interface and inspection/control equipment raised its current parent forecast to 5.00 billion yen from 3.70 billion.</p>
</text>
